{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 42, :comments ["<b>A night of watchings.</b> That the Holy One, blessed be He, was watching and waiting for it, to fulfill His promise <b>to bring them out of the land of Egypt</b>." "<b>It is this night to YHWH.</b> It is the night that He said to Abraham: On this night I am redeeming your children (Mekhilta)." "<b>Watchings for all the children of Israel for their generations.</b> Guarded and safe from the harmful beings, as it says: ״וְלֹא יִתֵּן הַמַּשְׁחִית״ and so forth (Pesachim 109)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:49.891177643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}